{"posts":[{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_101","t":"wallstreet closed:+44 pips.\n\nlooking for longs!","a":"sunnytrader1984","d":"","n":"#101","p":5,"im":["7241c5c2c9d2a1b51472c65bcac380f9660ed301"],"m":101},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_102","t":"USDJPY: scalp short closed.\n\nRisk: 5 pips Reward: 23 pips\n\nlong order pending!","a":"sunnytrader1984","d":"","n":"#102","p":5,"im":["3697d08ce7e293dff91b66e5e562f4b8fa55277e"],"m":102},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_103","t":"EURUSD: trade closed +22 pips.\n\nReason: engulfing and then arrival into demand.","a":"sunnytrader1984","d":"","n":"#103","p":5,"im":["e2f24750da48cc5beeddbd778c0a3c1ca8de2320"],"m":103},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_104","t":"sunnytrader1984 wrote: USDCHF: QM sell level on H4.\n\nDaily chart showing relevance of QM:\n\nUSDCHF closed from the QM level: +48 pips.","a":"sunnytrader1984","d":"","n":"#104","p":5,"im":["b4c95d5ec3cc65f50c618c06291fe22283d77289","acc65cb1818439a7a81cd00ad4808744a49a698c","81feab220ba172dcbf862d9b883aa4216378210b"],"m":104},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_105","t":"EURUSD: pending short triggered. reasoning on chart.\n\nMy long term bias is long but this looks like a good short opportunity to make some pips. I have a buy pending waiting down there, will put reasoning on next post.","a":"sunnytrader1984","d":"","n":"#105","p":5,"im":["6329720e8b89206eef79c88465b97ba35687e633"],"m":105},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_106","t":"here is my EURUSD long pending order explained.\n\nH1 chart showing potential targets or potential problem areas for the trade.\n\nHappy Easter weekend everybody.\n\nc u on tuesday!\n\nUPDATE: missed long entry by 6 pips. will wait for return to new buy!","a":"sunnytrader1984","d":"","n":"#106","p":5,"im":["8e201b8a5eb92b3439601204325d02e4e3b1f7ff","ec02390b821a3b45fb82ba9cfb63b02ffc5a435b"],"m":106},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_107","t":"GBPUSD pending short entry triggered. Reasoning on the chart.\n\nIncidentally, was the same level IF has written about in his journal. will update as and when the trade is complete...most likely on tuesday.\n\nHappy easter weekend everybody!","a":"sunnytrader1984","d":"","n":"#107","p":5,"im":["38e02286e85f1c3f90f63e4f12f7e12defaa5ed8"],"m":107},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_108","t":"sunnytrader1984 wrote: EURUSD: pending short triggered. reasoning on chart.\n\nMy long term bias is long but this looks like a good short opportunity to make some pips. I have a buy pending waiting down there, will put reasoning on next post.\n\nTarget hit +46 pips.","a":"sunnytrader1984","d":"","n":"#108","p":5,"im":["6329720e8b89206eef79c88465b97ba35687e633","d5525a382cc21aa15c81b35d86a1e623304c0bff"],"m":108},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_109","t":"USDCHF closed: target hit: +80 pips.\n\nreasoning on chart!","a":"sunnytrader1984","d":"","n":"#109","p":5,"im":["0213113f8a265718e0ad67e5dcadded9a0f7a6c9"],"m":109},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_110","t":"AUDUSD in a H4 QM sell zone, getting ready if something might setup.","a":"sunnytrader1984","d":"","n":"#110","p":5,"im":["609f11263be130d24f315e6f533828469eb9cf8d"],"m":110},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_111","t":"GBPUSD: closed +52 pips.\n\nSuspecting the price to go back to the QM sell level before continuing further down. why down? engulf of the low!\n\nwhy I took the trade?\n\nFinal result:","a":"sunnytrader1984","d":"","n":"#111","p":5,"im":["c384e57d412dae6e223572b3bff4879c68bc0e05","28759a3c21cba593da6fc4c1b672e0671a41370e"],"m":111},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_112","t":"CHFJPY: a quick scalp +35 pips.","a":"sunnytrader1984","d":"","n":"#112","p":5,"im":["ce82a87e21d71e476ab8d6f1cd83ff2c4b6267fe"],"m":112},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_113","t":"USDJPY: +44 pips closed.\n\nLooking at the chart, it seems like I missed a big part of the move, just woke up and saw this big move up, but of late I have been setting my targets at the first possible area where the price can turn and have been doing much better than what I have done so far. Taking what is obvious rather than breaking my head hoping for the price to go where I want it to go. there is no shortage of opportunities in this game here.\n\nGood luck everyone.","a":"sunnytrader1984","d":"","n":"#113","p":5,"im":["c9b3576af5cb7155860b4d7480beba9ae5fd7f65"],"m":113},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_114","t":"CHFJPY: closed +73 pips.","a":"sunnytrader1984","d":"","n":"#114","p":5,"im":["7add8297a84f52d9859be57cbdf94b00faaaeaa6"],"m":114},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_115","t":"sunnytrader1984\n\nUSDCHF: +22 pips closed.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#115","p":5,"im":["5622200cabb4192318bb0de7984590473cc49794"],"m":115},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_116","t":"wohhoo.. congrats Sunny... u did awesome job.. ~^o^~","a":"faldot","d":"","n":"#116","p":5,"im":["c33995e9983ebb686b12dfb2ad623de260494e58"],"m":116},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_117","t":"sunnytrader1984\n\nGOLD closed +94 pips.\n\nM30: interesting area for interesting price action to happen.\n\nM15: PA showing why I took the trade. Missed the picture perfect entry by few minutes.\n\nReason to close the trade: obvious demand in front, no need to fight with it. Will wait and see what more comes. +94 isnt bad either.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#117","p":5,"im":["4ef7209b6c6ef0291f878e21608fecb96eb691dc","cfe80feecbe81a01f7cf37f50b8dc446cb525cc7"],"m":117},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_118","t":"Congrats! Your progress is remarkable.","a":"Carousel","d":"","n":"#118","p":5,"im":[],"m":118},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_119","t":"Hi Carousel\n\nI dont know about my progress, but the quality of education here is remarkable.\n\nP.S.: Did you follow on the EURGBP trade. I did not keep my pending orders over the weekend. just saw, the price neatly came into the my pending order area and about to hit the first target. Damn, I should have kept it.","a":"sunnytrader1984","d":"","n":"#119","p":5,"im":[],"m":119},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_120","t":"Your equity curve best reflects the progress, but you can also see it when you look at cluttered charts on the first page of your journal in comparison to your recent charts. It is night and day. Simple, neat, nice!\n\nNo, I did not follow on EG. I am looking for other opps. I can see it finally cleared the road for upmove to the nearest supply around,8550.","a":"Carousel","d":"","n":"#120","p":5,"im":[],"m":120},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_121","t":"Absolutely fantastic trading here Sunny. You are helping me see the importance of watching for the engulf of the level which clears the way for the move. Your use of pending orders is really great. I think that this could help me a lot since I'm not always patient enough to wait for the return to the origin of the move.\n\nNice work!","a":"DharmaTrader","d":"","n":"#121","p":5,"im":[],"m":121},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_122","t":"GOLD long closed: +120 pips.","a":"sunnytrader1984","d":"","n":"#122","p":5,"im":["ca3791cad89993f0c1e0984bf9c1f80a082455a3"],"m":122},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_123","t":"Nice FO trade on gold!","a":"AERO","d":"","n":"#123","p":5,"im":[],"m":123},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_124","t":"marvellous trade Sunny! BTW, what does PO mean?","a":"Carousel","d":"","n":"#124","p":5,"im":[],"m":124},{"id":"sunnytrader_p5_125","t":"Hi Carousel\n\nThanks.\n\nPO = pending order.","a":"sunnytrader1984","d":"","n":"#125","p":5,"im":[],"m":125}],"images":[{"k":"b4c95d5ec3cc65f50c618c06291fe22283d77289","t":"assets/thumbs/b4c95d5ec3cc65f50c618c06291fe22283d77289.webp","f":"assets/images/b4c95d5ec3cc65f50c618c06291fe22283d77289.png","w":1362,"h":559,"b":27668,"o":"b4c95d5ec3cc65f50c618c06291fe22283d77289.png","p":5,"pid":"sunnytrader_p5_104"},{"k":"acc65cb1818439a7a81cd00ad4808744a49a698c","t":"assets/thumbs/acc65cb1818439a7a81cd00ad4808744a49a698c.webp","f":"assets/images/acc65cb1818439a7a81cd00ad4808744a49a698c.png","w":1362,"h":559,"b":24332,"o":"acc65cb1818439a7a81cd00ad4808744a49a698c.png","p":5,"pid":"sunnytrader_p5_104"},{"k":"7241c5c2c9d2a1b51472c65bcac380f9660ed301","t":"assets/thumbs/7241c5c2c9d2a1b51472c65bcac380f9660ed301.webp","f":"assets/images/7241c5c2c9d2a1b51472c65bcac380f9660ed301.png","w":1362,"h":586,"b":28865,"o":"7241c5c2c9d2a1b51472c65bcac380f96